From 925bd85b60c98f26a6336def8dc0524f98a2fd19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BellSoft <info@bell-sw.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:31:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Recognise the vendor's distributions by the module's identity

osvecosystem.EcosystemVendorLinux / EcosystemVendorHardened (valid ecosystems,
apk versions, provided-name aliases) are recognised from the module's os-release
ids and are local-only (osvecosystem.IsLocalOnly) when the module's default source
is not the osv.dev bucket.
